## Subject Tutor (Math Tutor)

### Prompt Strategy
- System prompt sets the tutor persona as patient, knowledgeable, and supportive.
- Instructions direct the bot to provide step-by-step explanations, ask clarifying questions, and scaffold complex concepts.
- Q&A flows use incremental, guided problem-solving and invite users to engage at their own pace.

### Tone Control
- All feedback is positive and encouraging (“Great job!”, “Excellent work!”).
- Mistakes are explained gently, with offers to revisit unclear steps.
- Fallback is open and collaborative (“Can you share more details about your question? I’m here to help!”).

### Contextual Flow
- Tutor bot remembers previous topics, adapts difficulty based on answers, and references earlier learning (“Want to try another quadratic?”).
- Large problems broken into manageable steps with constant feedback.

